=2 Walkthrough
* Your goal is to get to the **Mahogany Door** in the {z:Sacrificial Chamber} for a cutscene. Along the way, there will be glowing **???**s in the {z:Temple of Uggalepih} and {z:Den of Rancor} that give tablet Key Items which will be helpful in the upcoming battlefield. Each tablet will grant a specific buff.
** At max level, you only need 1 tablet to get the cutscene from the **Mahogany Door**: one possible way is to warp to {z:Den of Rancor} Home Point #1, exit south via the switch, grab the {@k} {k:Tablet of Hexes: Blight} at (H-9), warp back to {z:Den of Rancor} Home Point #1, and continue to the {z:Sacrificial Chamber}.
** If you're attempting the upcoming battle below level 99, collecting all the tablets will make the fight easier.
* Tablets can be found at the following locations:
** Tablets found in {z:Temple of Uggalepih}:
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Malice}: (F-10) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Deceit}: (F-8) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Envy}: (F-8) Map 2
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Greed}: (G-10) Map 2
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Pride}: (J-11) Map 2
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Bale}: (I-8) Map 2
** Tablets found in {z:Den of Rancor}:
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Regret}: (E-5) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Strife}: (H-6) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Dolor}: (J-9) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Agony}: (E-10) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Rancor}: (F-11) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Rage}: (K-11) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Despair}: (J-13) Map 1
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Penury}: (F-9) Map 3
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Death}: (L-13) Map 2
*** {k:Tablet of Hexes: Blight}: (H-9) Map 2

* In the {z:Sacrificial Chamber}, check the **Mahogany Door** and then check again to begin the fight for the next mission: {M:Project: Shantottofication|A Shantotto Ascension Mission 13|Project: Shantottofication}.

